L('reply','agree',Y,F,[("Tell the governor yes.","glad")])
L('reply','ask',Y,F,[("What comes with it, and who would I answer to?","guarded")])
L('reply','decline',Y,F,[("I'll pass. I'd be voting on my own district's money.","calm")])
L('reply','bargain',Y,F,[("I'll take it if I keep my own voice. Nobody tells me what to say.","guarded")])
